      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <div class="why-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3 class="why-title">Clear & Direct</h3>
        <p class="why-description">No fluff. Concise, jargon-free writing that respects your time and intelligence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <div class="why-icon">💡</div>
        <h3 class="why-title">Evidence-Based</h3>
        <p class="why-description">Strategies grounded in psychology, behavioral science, and real-world application.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <div class="why-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="why-title">Instant Access</h3>
