<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="faq-container">
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-question">What format is the guide?</h3>
      <p class="faq-answer">The guides are delivered as downloadable PDFs that you can read on any device, anytime, anywhere. No account needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-question">Can I return or refund?</h3>
      <p class="faq-answer">Digital purchases are generally non-refundable, but if you have issues accessing your guide, contact us immediately and we'll help.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-question">How long are the guides?</h3>
      <p class="faq-answer">Each guide is 20-24 pages designed for focused, distraction-free reading. Typically 45 minutes to an hour.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-question">Can I gift a guide?</h3>
      <p class="faq-answer">Yes! Purchase the guide and forward the download link to whoever you'd like. Perfect for colleagues or friends.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-question">Is there a guarantee?</h3>
      <p class="faq-answer">If you don't find the guide valuable within 30 days, email us for a full refund. We stand behind the quality.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>